  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avgift till Global Water Partnership Organisation (GWPO) 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commission to Global Water Partnership Organization (GWPO) 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget avser organisationens &#xe5;terst&#xe5;ende kostnader under v&#xe4;rdlandsavtalet. Dessa omfattar 1) reglering av faktiska kostnader f&#xf6;r lokal och personalskatter under 2025, 2) uppskattade kostnader f&#xf6;r lokal och personalskatter fr&#xe5;n och med 1 januari 2026 till och med 22 maj 2026, samt 3) kostnader f&#xf6;r att avsluta hyresavtalet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant covers the organization&#x2019;s remaining costs under the host country agreement. These include (1) settlement of actual costs for leased premises and staff taxes for 2025; (2) estimated costs for leased premises and staff taxes from 1 January 2026 up to and including 22 May 2026; and (3) costs related to the termination of the lease agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
